#: ../../SECURITY.md:2
msgid "Security"
msgstr "安全"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:4
msgid "Reporting a vulnerability"
msgstr "报告漏洞"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:6
msgid ""
"Report vulnerabilities through GitHub's private vulnerability reporting "
"for this repository: **Report a vulnerability** under the **Security** "
"tab. Do not open a public issue for anything you believe is exploitable."
msgstr ""
"请通过本仓库在 GitHub 上的私密漏洞报告功能报告漏洞：在 **Security** 标签页下选择 **Report a "
"vulnerability**。任何你认为可被利用的问题，都不要公开提 issue。"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:10
msgid ""
"Expect an acknowledgement within a few days. We will tell you what we "
"found, what we changed, and when the change shipped."
msgstr "一般几天内会回复确认。之后我们会告诉你查到了什么、改了什么，以及修复在什么时候发布。"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:13
msgid "What is in scope"
msgstr "受理范围"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:15
msgid ""
"The control plane, web app, runner host, and sandbox image in this "
"repository."
msgstr "本仓库中的控制平面、Web 应用、runner 主机和沙箱镜像。"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:16
msgid "The account system, its sessions and its waiting list."
msgstr "账号系统、它的会话和等候名单。"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:17
msgid "The committed API contract, `apps/backend/openapi.json`."
msgstr "已提交的 API 契约，即 `apps/backend/openapi.json`。"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:19
msgid ""
"A model provider that owners connect is not part of this service; report "
"a provider's issues to that provider."
msgstr "所有者接入的模型服务商不属于本服务；服务商的问题请向该服务商报告。"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:22
msgid "What a deployment must not assume"
msgstr "部署时不能想当然的地方"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:24
msgid ""
"The threat model is in [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md#7-security-boundaries--do-"
"not-relax-without-review) and the [operations "
"runbook](docs/developer/operations.md). Two requirements matter most:"
msgstr ""
"威胁模型见 [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md#7-security-boundaries--do-not-relax-without-"
"review) 和[运维手册](docs/developer/operations.md)。对部署最要紧的是两条要求："

#: ../../SECURITY.md:28
msgid ""
"The plain Docker runner profile isolates trusted repositories from each "
"other, not hostile code from the host. Do not offer it to untrusted "
"users."
msgstr "普通 Docker runner 配置只能把可信仓库彼此隔离开，不能把恶意代码与主机隔离。不要把它提供给不受信任的用户。"

#: ../../SECURITY.md:30
msgid ""
"The sandbox never holds a platform or administration credential. It holds"
" the owner's own provider key for the turn it runs, and short-lived "
"scoped tokens. On a model the deployment provides it holds no provider "
"key at all, only a placeholder that the control plane's model relay "
"accepts while that turn runs. Putting an admin token, or the deployment's"
" own provider key, into a sandbox removes the security property this "
"design rests on."
msgstr "沙箱从不持有平台凭据或管理凭据。它持有所有者自己的服务商密钥（仅限它运行的那一轮）以及短期的限定范围令牌。如果用的是部署提供的模型，它根本不持有服务商密钥，只持有一个占位凭据，只有控制平面的模型中继在那一轮运行期间才接受它。把管理员令牌或部署自己的服务商密钥放进沙箱，就破坏了这套设计赖以成立的安全属性。"

